e":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.012,"r5":0.0228,"r1_spy":0.0158,"r5_spy":0.0299}}],"quotes":[{"c":"ENSG 2019 Q1","e":"ensg","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Suzanne D. Snapper","x":"As Christopher mentioned, we increased our guidance for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2019 Q2","e":"ensg","d":"2019-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Suzanne Snapper","x":"We think it will be slight, obviously with the market basket increase, we think that that offsets most of that headwind we were previously predicting I mean and the potential cost savings coming in probably after we get phased through the implementation of it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2019 Q2","e":"ensg","d":"2019-08-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Suzanne Snapper","x":"As Barry mentioned, we are reaffirming our annual guidance for 2019 which we increased last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2019 Q2","e":"ensg","d":"2019-08-02","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Frank Morgan","x":"I want to clarify or reiterate the guidance that you reiterated today still has Cornerstone/Pennant in it through the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2019 Q3","e":"ensg","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Barry R. Port","x":"When adjusting for only the fourth quarter impact of the Pennant spin-off, this newly increased 2019 guidance translates to between $2.15 and $2.21 per diluted share, an annual revenue of between $2.27 billion and $2.3 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2019 Q3","e":"ensg","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Suzanne D. Snapper","x":"The increased 2019 guidance is based on a tax rate of approximately 25%, the inclusion of acquisitions to the end of the year, the implementation of the new Patient Driven Payment Model, PDPM, with the primary exclusions coming from spin-off transaction cost and stock-based compensation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2019 Q4","e":"ensg","d":"2020-02-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Suzanne D. Snapper","x":"The increased 2020 guidance is based on diluted weighted average common shares outstanding of approximately $57.6 million, tax rate of 25%, the inclusion of acquisitions expected to close in the first half of the year, the exclusion of losses associated with start-up operations, which are not yet…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q1","e":"ensg","d":"2020-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Frank Morgan","x":"And you mentioned the FMAP, hoping you do -- hopeful of getting some rate increases pass through there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q1","e":"ensg","d":"2020-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barry Port","x":"The organization has implemented certain cost reduction initiatives, which included the voluntary reduction in base salaries by the Board of Directors, the executive team and other key organizational leaders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q1","e":"ensg","d":"2020-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barry Port","x":"The implementation of certain cost reduction initiatives and the positive news on both reimbursement stimulus funding are also other factors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q2","e":"ensg","d":"2020-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Frank Morgan","x":"I know you talked about a number of states that have actually passed through the FMAP increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q2","e":"ensg","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barry Port","x":"The strong results came from quarter-over-quarter improvements and skilled mix across same store, transitioning in newly acquired operations, cost saving initiatives, improved collections, sequestration suspension, and improved Medicaid rates in certain states.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q3","e":"ensg","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barry Port","x":"…from quarter-over-quarter improvements and skilled mix across the portfolio, improved admission trends, availability of more frequent and broader Covid testing, increased managed care revenues, cost-saving initiatives, improved collections sequestration suspension and improved medicaid rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q3","e":"ensg","d":"2020-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Barry Port","x":"The midpoint of this 2021 guidance represents an increase of approximately 14% over the midpoint of our newly increased 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q3","e":"ensg","d":"2020-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Suzanne D. Snapper","x":"The midpoint of this increased 2020 guidance represents a 58% increase over our 2019 spin-adjusted results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q4","e":"ensg","d":"2021-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barry Port","x":"…trends, availability of more frequent and broader COVID testing, increased managed care volumes, cost saving initiatives, improved cash collections, sequestration suspension and improved Medicaid funding in certain states. During the latest and most significant surge of COVID-19 positivity rates","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ENSG 2020 Q4","e":"ensg","d":"2021-02-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Barry Port","x":"We are again reaffirming our guidance for 2021 with annual earnings per share guidance of $3.44 to $3.56 per diluted share and annual revenue guidance of $2.62 billion to $2.69 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ENSG 2021 Q1","e":"ensg","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barry Port","x":"…also a result of a multi-faceted effort, which included making continued progress in our companywide cost saving initiatives, improving our cash collections and making significant strides in our operational expense management as some of the extra COVID-related expenses has started to decline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/ensign-group-inc-ensg-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ENSG 2021 Q1","e":"ensg","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Frank Morgan","x":"And obviously you've had lots of cost reduction programs in place and cost management programs in place.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/